{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-5", "avgTag": "行動後", "storyName": "匯流", "storyInfo": "不願欺瞞米諾斯的緹緹決定盜走假琴，卡珊卓拉、萊娜與赫卡德墨則決定從死牢中救出他們的朋友、病人與兄弟。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$dignified_intro", "key": "$dignified_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "約我過來的人反而一言不發？為了陪你，我可是推掉了第一神殿初步建成的慶功宴啊。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "能在交換儀式前一天按計劃完成重建工作，你功不可沒。照慣例這是要慶祝整整一天的，工匠們從白天就開始吟詩喝酒了。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有些人的酒量不太好，要是貪杯，我猜今天晚上治安官就有得忙了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，你說的是搬運隊的坎提亞吧？你幫了她好幾次，那個小妹妹很喜歡你。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……來雅賽努斯的這幾天就像做夢一樣。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對啊。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "到雅賽努斯的第一天你就解決了果農和工匠的爭執，後來又成為神殿重建收尾階段的負責人。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "前幾天豎琴被盜，你還追了贊索斯好幾條街。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪件事都比護送文物有趣多了，不是嗎？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但保證交換儀式順利進行，增進兩國友好，才是我本來最該做的事。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，你怎麼了？這些話不像是你會說的啊？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢使節團帶來的克瑞斯拉豎琴……是仿製品。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#17$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#17$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要不是贊索斯先生跟我爭奪豎琴，不小心弄壞了琴，我也不會發現豎琴有問題。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在使節團的副使貝赫努先生想用修補好的假琴進行交換儀式，完成帕夏交給我們的任務……但這件事不該這樣收場。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，明天就是交換儀式了，你今天找我，是不是已經想到了解決方法？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#8$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說實話，除非出現神蹟，否則沒有任何妥善的解決方法。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我翻閱了雅賽努斯圖書館能借閱到的所有相關古籍，發現克瑞斯拉豎琴很早就在戰爭中佚失，完全沒有蹤跡。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我猜測，連製作這把仿製品的薩爾貢工匠都只見過圖紙，沒有接觸過真品。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是不是說明真琴很有可能就在米諾斯？或者……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早就被戰爭的炮火轟成灰燼了……對不起。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你不需要道歉。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然真琴的下落難以追覓，你打算怎麼做？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我無法在大庭廣眾之下以薩爾貢大使的身分宣告我們帶來的是假琴，我很擔心這樣的舉動，比起揭露真相，更有可能再次引發衝突。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，你的顧慮沒有錯。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，終止儀式只能靠個人行為。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼意思？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要在儀式開始之前，帶走假琴。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g4_athenusstreet", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness02_intro", "key": "$darkness02_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不能進去。", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道探監和寄送物資都需要特殊的訪客證明，但我不就是太急了所以忘記帶嘛……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您能不能通融一下，我那個老同學前天剛進去，什麼都沒準備，他家人請我帶一些東西給他。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，我實話跟您說吧，他病得很重，可能很快就……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雅賽努斯的監管所雖然配備了醫生和基礎藥物，但當地的藥物沒有羅德島帶來的有效，要是抑制不住，恐怕在拘留期間就會發作。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別跟我說這些，沒用。", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "獄警女士，我真的不想這樣……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喏，看到工作證了嗎？我是理事官的執筆人，赫卡德墨。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原則上我有進入監管所甚至提審嫌疑人的權力，雖然中間要經過幾道必要手續，但事後我會補齊。現在，我命令你開門。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你要見的是前天那兩個偷東西的小偷？", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "呂刻伊昂不是……"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "算了，是他們。"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不行。", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為什麼還是不行！", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#5$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "執筆人確實可以探視監管所的犯人，但你說的那兩位，已經不在這裡了。", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "轉獄了？"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "真少見，難道是萊娜小姐想推行的感染者治療體系已經開始實施了……"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "麻煩請您告訴我他們去了哪座監管所？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，不要白費工夫了。赫卡德墨，我不知道對方到底跟你是什麼關係，但僅憑理事官執筆人的權限是進不了死牢的。", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.2, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "死牢？！", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g10_templegarden", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.6, "channel": "1"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "1", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，萊娜小姐……", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭……不，理事官小姐真的抽不出時間嗎？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我聽說，前幾天贊索斯先生和他的學生因偷竊罪被捕入獄。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他們都是我的病人，根據此前羅德島醫療點出具的報告，他們的礦石病治療都處在關鍵時期。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尤其是贊索斯先生，他這段時間的血液源石結晶密度非常高，很有可能會急性發作，如果能送一些藥物給他們……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萊娜小姐，就算您跟我說這些醫學名詞，我也聽不懂啊。", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您願意回到雅賽努斯，把您在醫療企業學會的治療方法帶回來，建立感染者醫療設施，我們都很感激，但……", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我本來不該說這麼多，不過您是一名好醫生，又是里底婭理事官的姐姐，考慮到你們兩個的關係，最近這幾天請您不要再來找她了。", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為什麼？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然對外宣稱的是偷竊罪，但前幾天薩爾貢使節團的大使找上了門，被搶走的根本不是使節的私人物品，而是用於交換的重要文物。", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那位大使先生向里底婭小姐施壓，可能等交換儀式結束就會正式宣判，向雅賽努斯民眾宣布那兩個人的叛國罪名。", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "叛國？！怎麼如此嚴重？根據米諾斯的法律——", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$2"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萊娜小姐，里底婭理事官處理的大部分問題，都不是依據法律流程就能解決的問題。", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她想要一個不一樣的、更現代的米諾斯，她願意為此付出一切，這也是我們願意為她工作的原因。", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或許您不知道，里底婭小姐就是為了理事官的位置，才主動放棄了家族的繼承權，上任之後還把失勢的家族成員趕出了雅賽努斯……", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "萊娜", "content": "主動放棄……"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "萊娜", "content": "我本來以為只是經營不善……"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這次文物交換是她推行行政改革的重要環節，不能出現任何差錯，至少表面上不能。哪怕……哪怕會犧牲兩名本來就犯了罪的小偷……", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2"}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，我實在是……我先回去工作了。", "name": "文職人員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.6, "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "2", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "150,0", "duration": 1.5, "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "萊娜", "content": "里底婭到底……"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "萊娜", "content": "唉，她現在不肯見我，就算見面了恐怕我也很難說服她。"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但贊索斯先生和呂刻伊昂應當得到公正的判決，我不能讓里底婭犯下這麼大的錯，該怎麼辦……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "bstart": 0.1, "bend": 0.3, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "3"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "3", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "200,0", "posto": "-130,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_punchsp3", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 80.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-120,0", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "-130,0", "posto": "-10,0", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "bstart": 0.1, "bend": 0.3, "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "實在抱歉，我現在思緒真是一團亂麻，沒看路——", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "190,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5, "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萊娜小姐？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-50,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "50,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$plot_intro", "key": "$plot_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您一直在看窗外，里底婭理事官。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是我失禮了，卡珊卓拉祭司。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為什麼不把萊娜小姐請進來？正好我也需要跟她商議建立感染者醫療體系的事。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦？我以為您是想多找個幫手，為前幾天入獄的那兩個感染者求情。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那位叫贊索斯的擺渡人似乎與您關係匪淺，他能在渡口謀生還多虧了您的幫忙？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "偷竊一事會由治安官全權處理，無需你我擔心。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "恐怕我無法置身事外，如果影響到了兩國之間的信任關係，那最終對這起事件的定調就不會是單純的偷竊……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1"}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是我要解決的事，與恩底彌翁神殿的祭司無關。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "言歸正傳吧，卡珊卓拉祭司。明天文物交換儀式開場的戲劇已經選定，劇團會出演深受泰拉各國歡迎的經典劇目《帕底斯王》。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#2$1"}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "神殿祭司們只要出席就好，無需像在神殿舉行祭祀儀式那樣費盡周章。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#2$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幾週前我曾找您商議，克瑞斯拉第一神殿建成後，需由祭司主導舉行戲劇儀式……之後我就再也沒在理事官辦公室找到過您。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "事務繁忙請多諒解。我記得您說的這件事，文物交換同樣需要戲劇開場，一舉兩得——只是不用勞煩祭司。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "恕我直言，重建克瑞斯拉第一神殿是凝聚民眾精神的大事，現在它已順利落成，按照傳統應當奉請英雄進入神殿，庇佑米諾斯。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "議事廳並非想要收回您在雅賽努斯的行政權，文物交換也確實屬於您的職責範疇。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但米諾斯戲劇在變成文化娛樂之前，原本就是祭祀的一部分。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#10$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "道具、戲劇內容、演出者都有明確的講究，不是隨便找一齣受人歡迎的劇目就夠的——", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#10$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“不朽的傳說”、“通曉神諭之人的見證”、“英雄的遺物”……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不是對傳統儀式一竅不通，只會大喊廢除糟粕的激進派，卡珊卓拉祭司。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算現在劇目任由您選擇，專業劇團也由您指揮，您想要的傳統祭祀儀式，也還差一樣東西不是嗎？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……薩爾貢使節團帶來了克瑞斯拉的豎琴。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦？您竟然會承認那件文物在祭祀方面的權威性？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#4$1"}, {"id": 265, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭理事官，您這是什麼意思……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不是文物鑑定的專家，也不是熟諳古籍的學者，但在理事官這個位置上，我瞭解議事廳的每個祭司，也瞭解您。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您是恩底彌翁神殿的主管祭司，又是能代眾英雄發聲的天賦之人，您精通各類英雄傳說，在這方面的造詣遠超一般學者。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但奇怪的是，聽聞薩爾貢使節團帶來了克瑞斯拉的豎琴之後，您竟然對此毫無興趣，甚至沒有要求一睹其真容……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我雖然不知道到底出了什麼問題，但至少可以肯定，薩爾貢使節團帶來的那把琴並非您認知中的英雄遺物。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "傳統的戲劇儀式，本就不可能舉行。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我已經……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉祭司，我無意針對議事廳。若是您確實能帶來讓戲劇儀式成立的“英雄遺物”，那我肯定會把選擇劇目的權力交給您。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只可惜，百年來各神殿用於祭祀的遺物大多只是粗糙的替代品。我想您比我更清楚，英雄與米諾斯人的連結正在減弱。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正因如此，現代國家凝聚民眾精神，不能再依靠古老的神話。請放心，卡珊卓拉小姐，神殿與祭司並不會因為時代變遷徹底消失。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們還可以為歷史研究和旅遊業做貢獻，不是嗎？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#2$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}